  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "快哉此遊！",
      "output_sha256": "019ffdba9c19179fcc17b94c3874ca35ebdbcf5dd881642829a718c2760729e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "019ffdba9c19179fcc17b94c3874ca35ebdbcf5dd881642829a718c2760729e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "檳榔嶼實在是名不虛傳的東方花縣。",
      "output_sha256": "a595c119e9c2f2791f44e12dd476710530d821ee2556a899ef2358319c5dc61c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "a595c119e9c2f2791f44e12dd476710530d821ee2556a899ef2358319c5dc61c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（人家或稱作花園我卻以爲花縣兩字來得適當。",
      "output_sha256": "e84d310f1f23197283ffb40fcf82af7d957c41b43eb66061e4e796b1ed0bc1ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "e84d310f1f23197283ffb40fcf82af7d957c41b43eb66061e4e796b1ed0bc1ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "蓋四季的花木蘢蔥，而且依山帶水，氣候溫和，住在檳城，“絕似河陽縣裏居”也。）",
      "output_sha256": "8d0c8c1f42f3839abbd3cf496a61c8053424060045d383cc7525315fd938a639",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d0c8c1f42f3839abbd3cf496a61c8053424060045d383cc7525315fd938a639",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "回想起這半年的旅程，離開武漢，遊歷湘西與贛北，然後又回到長沙，接著前往福州定居。",
      "output_sha256": "43cf85571b16ac60b1a8ca99ae629d5f15ec8ef30003149baec22d9ad9872b46",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.457698,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "46fb5b5c3ba9d614057e37adf15e0fc29e158d454d2eb257e758582eaeee2c5e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "43cf85571b16ac60b1a8ca99ae629d5f15ec8ef30003149baec22d9ad9872b46",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "隨後忽然接到胡氏兆祥的邀請，匆匆購舟，偷渡至廈門，經香港前往星洲，再由星洲抵達檳榔嶼，經歷幾萬里，耗時五十天，風塵僕僕，夢魂搖曳，突然來到這個安靜、悠閒、有序、舒適的小島，真有如置身夢境。",
      "output_sha256": "1cd0ac3675ee4bde8cb6eb2509f6a2a525ab0ebbeeaee67cbd65fbc22aae14f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.512305,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f668d0beefac71b1914a055b8384121a5b1fbeb51f73f4c5521be57ad07ead71"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1cd0ac3675ee4bde8cb6eb2509f6a2a525ab0ebbeeaee67cbd65fbc22aae14f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是夢也吧，是現實也吧，總之，是“三宿檳城戀有餘”也！",
      "output_sha256": "9b8142dba7611d7c5b9b5d5a406d60fb388116a4bc19bc3c0ac0dc8fbf99877b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b8142dba7611d7c5b9b5d5a406d60fb388116a4bc19bc3c0ac0dc8fbf99877b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此番的下南洋，本來是爲《星洲日報》編副刊來的。",
      "output_sha256": "0e0ee9a90e32a7535dee1f5fbe59b114a910c3e80ada63bf3c27701caeced8ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "0e0ee9a90e32a7535dee1f5fbe59b114a910c3e80ada63bf3c27701caeced8ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而在十二月二十八日抵達星洲，兩日後便是新年假期。",
      "output_sha256": "0b674004fe2cacd8992a7423ce28ce291470cfc5142b21ed2e87480bd3c4e597",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.607213,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a077589aff275f3f4cf50c1ca7bd9adf4be0f6f4c9834db7bc6370e8e53a50e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0b674004fe2cacd8992a7423ce28ce291470cfc5142b21ed2e87480bd3c4e597",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "卻正逢星洲的兄弟報，檳城《星檳日報》，於元旦日開始發行，秉文虎先生之命，又承星檳諸同事之招，謂“值此佳期，何不北來一玩！”",
      "output_sha256": "a1b3e6238cd6fabf4968cddc73de82b017bfaddffaefd603d6266a65bcf907db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1b3e6238cd6fabf4968cddc73de82b017bfaddffaefd603d6266a65bcf907db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "於是乎就青春結伴，和關老同車，驅馳千五百里，搖搖擺擺地上這東方的花縣來了。",
      "output_sha256": "7d2036924229654c8fd7537133238f6ff2cf79dcfbc3dc8ea36da208b1fc309c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d2036924229654c8fd7537133238f6ff2cf79dcfbc3dc8ea36da208b1fc309c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "車至北海，映入眼簾的是許多高雅整齊的洋樓，堤岸如齒，碧海一灣，青山幾座。",
      "output_sha256": "8411c060c56ca99ce06ca0e36531cfe6d95ce58e70fb9386b98125f14dce8875",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.484959,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0142cdbff99024b53100ab63a0b517c88bb885cc76e00b96b1f74dcfdf477477"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8411c060c56ca99ce06ca0e36531cfe6d95ce58e70fb9386b98125f14dce8875",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在車窗裏看見的那些椰子園、樹膠園、金馬侖的高山，怡保附近的奇峯怪石，以及錫礦探掘場等印象，一忽兒又爲這整潔、寬廣、閒適的新印象掩沒下去了，我們就在微風與夕照的交響樂中間，西渡到了檳城。",
      "output_sha256": "2ac40eaa94e7decff91d1e17ff69531ab9cc44ac978037089868b3fd73728fc6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ac40eaa94e7decff91d1e17ff69531ab9cc44ac978037089868b3fd73728fc6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "船抵西碼頭，迎接我們的是一陣熱情的擁抱，黃領事、胡總經理、胡主筆、鄧曾張三先生，還有A老兄、B大哥，真令人感慨“到處論交齊管鮑，天涯何地不家鄉”的淚水。",
      "output_sha256": "cd481cb0b3696ffad3c9c3d81b1a34705b2f6945af42d6f559bfb4597bde3e9b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.692459,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3adfaf9bb89039c455986160443ac535cb59fb2f5bb43765f07001bd7b77185f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cd481cb0b3696ffad3c9c3d81b1a34705b2f6945af42d6f559bfb4597bde3e9b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "初到的當晚，我們在北海岸的春波別業（Spring Tide Hotel）享用了晚餐，宛如天上盛宴。",
      "output_sha256": "94d8d3efe09b8a70d9b2687299a99d2fc592f728131104e6a72eb7e9561fe796",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.613791,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f750203e338120ef168a9197f526f2dde73679953b986ce6f3d4fd5b6e303d02"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "94d8d3efe09b8a70d9b2687299a99d2fc592f728131104e6a72eb7e9561fe796",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "先不必提魚翅海蔘等老饕的口頭禪，你且聽一聽這洗岸的濤聲，看一看這長途的列樹，這銀色的燈光，這長長的海岸堤路！",
      "output_sha256": "7480cd19f6d44791622729c7feda9c18df4631a0d0d158f27e806a73098dc30a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "7480cd19f6d44791622729c7feda9c18df4631a0d0d158f27e806a73098dc30a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "住宅區的房屋，是曲線與紅白青黃等顏色交織而成的；燈光似水，列樹如雲，在長堤上走着，更時時有美人在夢裏呼吸似的氣噓吹來，這不是微風，這簡直是百花仙子撅着嘴，向你一口一口吹出來的香氣。",
      "output_sha256": "e6953ed3df15ec3cd156fc303f6316f9ea76c239e79183d56f198e382bb503d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "e6953ed3df15ec3cd156fc303f6316f9ea76c239e79183d56f198e382bb503d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一晚，像這樣的匆匆過了。",
      "output_sha256": "65011894dd6e053377798d2bcf8aae81d6afd553f61b42a63fbfb9505580c3ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "65011894dd6e053377798d2bcf8aae81d6afd553f61b42a63fbfb9505580c3ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第二天，就上了升旗山的絕頂。",
      "output_sha256": "058b1efdbdfe0db4d4a40d9eedf446918b777a0d590d57dd7cb389bdf822c67d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "058b1efdbdfe0db4d4a40d9eedf446918b777a0d590d57dd7cb389bdf822c67d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "海拔二千四五百英尺，纜車分兩段，沿途的岩石、溪流、花木和別墅，令人目不暇接，尤其映襯在這片海光山色、天日風雲之下，更是生動絢麗的景象，與我們這群旅友的存在相得益彰，因為地靈人傑，方顯畫中的滄桑。",
      "output_sha256": "bfc87ee66965a4faf04bfbb2cb7a8ff0c83b6a2d45f7625cbcecdb9156dd4acf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.453756,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a8e20adbd74512d72780a100ff6aa4573e214b5584410cea7ae59e2c643d620d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bfc87ee66965a4faf04bfbb2cb7a8ff0c83b6a2d45f7625cbcecdb9156dd4acf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "讓我先記下同行者的名單。",
      "output_sha256": "848f72e555f508f32e762022ed9045944b233155247c44975e9d948932d11cdd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.357787,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d36895fbeaace071cb2b8bd72e7ec3869a24b280ea05e0f00dd3895b7d8ed41e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "848f72e555f508f32e762022ed9045944b233155247c44975e9d948932d11cdd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "黃領事、胡總經理、胡主筆夫婦、曾祕書夫婦、鄧先生夫婦、林小姐、馬利小姐、關夫子與區區。",
      "output_sha256": "0092080820e7ecdac8784d556c0105b230e0020ed1df7c7d961b668d283c1c2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "0092080820e7ecdac8784d556c0105b230e0020ed1df7c7d961b668d283c1c2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一行十二人，佔車兩節半。",
      "output_sha256": "1f18014b9deb9b137edff3bdfec3c38f1b1ab964983c3d5eaf6c0cbe0189e4fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f18014b9deb9b137edff3bdfec3c38f1b1ab964983c3d5eaf6c0cbe0189e4fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到了山腰，已覺得空氣寒冷，呼吸有點兒緊起來了，回頭一看，更覺得是煙雲繚繞，身體已化作魂靈，遊弋在天半的空中。",
      "output_sha256": "6df3c235fc46de852d15ceec94b54e21a80047ed29d808e373f914582297b92c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "6df3c235fc46de852d15ceec94b54e21a80047ed29d808e373f914582297b92c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "屋頂鳞次櫛比的是喬其市的煙囪；白牆碧水，環繞著層層樹木的，是兩個蓄水池的區域；青山隱隱，綠水迢迢，從高處俯瞰，極樂寺的高塔，宛如一頂黃色的斗笠。",
      "output_sha256": "c11768d8d56623e16c6074bcb923431505409b5cddb5436234a68d4cd41fc286",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.691303,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d8259eb5726978f6903ea13777a49c5f8106dc0573505f2a3bdf564c28028e9c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c11768d8d56623e16c6074bcb923431505409b5cddb5436234a68d4cd41fc286",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "再往上走，便到了山頂；沿著彎彎曲曲的柏油路，路邊擺滿了溫帶地區的秋花，有西方蓮（大麗花）、四季春、榆兒梅和五月花（繡球花）。",
      "output_sha256": "0f395aee9d33e8080155a9fb77ea693301063ef32f2fea1160e83569c56c7a0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.599348,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6f34e5243c1c9394cd84b8ab7e4b62783c21481fe8a1e8b1dff22a866f1141b6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0f395aee9d33e8080155a9fb77ea693301063ef32f2fea1160e83569c56c7a0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而最令人注意的，卻是幾盆顏色不同，種子各異的紅黃白紫的陶家秋菊。",
      "output_sha256": "d5dbeeda26333b451478ed1a9aba1959c86caee3a67f9bb7af689778b6e3bd2a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "d5dbeeda26333b451478ed1a9aba1959c86caee3a67f9bb7af689778b6e3bd2a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "胡邁太太說：“好久不看見菊花了，真令人高興！”",
      "output_sha256": "a957621ca5a0e9c169dddc457d0a22218e408512f93b628e1ecc9c9f5ccb70d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "a957621ca5a0e9c169dddc457d0a22218e408512f93b628e1ecc9c9f5ccb70d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這句話實在有點兒詩意，我暗暗在心裏記住了。",
      "output_sha256": "2e571c2eaf5ea021660d74d256bfc644e4ea6367f60fd19a60d14c22b41faa56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e571c2eaf5ea021660d74d256bfc644e4ea6367f60fd19a60d14c22b41faa56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "瞬間，高山上雲霧升起，輕盈如飛絮般掠過我們的肩頭；腳下的市鎮溪山，彷彿沉浸在雲海中；我們彼此對視，感受到隱隱的幻影，似在袅袅香煙中，童心再現，我們這群大小，竟如樂園中的童男童女，一同卸下了尊嚴，重拾自然，齊聲呼喊：",
      "output_sha256": "5fc0c062d71f2735651a25cd4c7b0bad7742f743071f49391c815218be951874",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.465503,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "910838a36aa3f175eb3a33a153f5a54b9fb08b04ad66ac30647d3f79a5fdbec8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5fc0c062d71f2735651a25cd4c7b0bad7742f743071f49391c815218be951874",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我們已經到了天上！”",
      "output_sha256": "9fbc7cc343dcb0f7f34bec8548f27debeb0d80336ccb42ec6e74853fd2c97dc4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "9fbc7cc343dcb0f7f34bec8548f27debeb0d80336ccb42ec6e74853fd2c97dc4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在茶室裏坐定，吃了些咖啡紅茶，點心果餅之後，我一個人行出茶室來，又上山頂高處，獨立在雲霧中間，向北凝視了一回，正在登高望遠，生起感傷病來的當兒，關先生走近我的身邊來了；他拂了一拂雲霧，微笑着說：",
      "output_sha256": "ee55891136312982dc8e40b4ec5445d745853e6d3959ef52043dab729aa931cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee55891136312982dc8e40b4ec5445d745853e6d3959ef52043dab729aa931cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“這景象有點兒像廬山，大好河山，要幾時才收復得來！",
      "output_sha256": "88a35d518c3a7f28649abaf9fb4ed1fc4fd6717d9bb4e80148ba17be52b8df9f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "88a35d518c3a7f28649abaf9fb4ed1fc4fd6717d9bb4e80148ba17be52b8df9f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你的詩料，收集得怎麼樣了？”",
      "output_sha256": "f354b199410540f93b565622c0710c74ff0300e4952e8da0f0f4fa1f9ba6465f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.611364,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "94dc5e3e906990e52b3283205272d35b20eb14d6c0c02ac039e50f8f6a899681"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f354b199410540f93b565622c0710c74ff0300e4952e8da0f0f4fa1f9ba6465f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我雖也只回了他一笑，但心中落寞，卻早想着了下面的兩首打油菜子：",
      "output_sha256": "ad16000b42349491d61840b134cb4cb537c7dc129d3a5442063396f8bdd9caa4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "ad16000b42349491d61840b134cb4cb537c7dc129d3a5442063396f8bdd9caa4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好山多半被雲遮，北望中原路正賒，",
      "output_sha256": "f1b5392f56c4963d3be13ecba64227afdc72fc56e21c0e32c4f7d96528965051",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "f1b5392f56c4963d3be13ecba64227afdc72fc56e21c0e32c4f7d96528965051",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "高處旗升風日淡，南天冬盡見秋花。",
      "output_sha256": "0c51436a7e2920bdbac7b1c57600a8665672259d7c178eeb8b48806d8675b136",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c51436a7e2920bdbac7b1c57600a8665672259d7c178eeb8b48806d8675b136",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這是用胡太太的那句詩詞作的。",
      "output_sha256": "82c08c31b7d24fd25d975c5ce977da43653073cc3e50fb06244b56d12e5c4def",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.755769,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "026ba8f697f2e92108fbfe852667b47ce2fc0b3eb6a8a9f3f18c85e3ba9cf739"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "82c08c31b7d24fd25d975c5ce977da43653073cc3e50fb06244b56d12e5c4def",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "匡廬曾記昔年遊，掛席名山孟氏舟，",
      "output_sha256": "bef85b76b837f6c7af1518e2a0481192cebbb408c992f45eceb6065b7ccfd64d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "bef85b76b837f6c7af1518e2a0481192cebbb408c992f45eceb6065b7ccfd64d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "誰分倉皇南渡日，一瓢猶得住瀛洲。",
      "output_sha256": "3c4a83d863e81ef7e0381a284bca2f39fd4c9d03130dcf86165774ee6d8c86a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c4a83d863e81ef7e0381a284bca2f39fd4c9d03130dcf86165774ee6d8c86a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這是印證關先生當前那句話的。",
      "output_sha256": "8dd7650a4fb0c6fec234249ac76d30aa3412867df6ddce52acca291e765543c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.585714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dcad3e669bc7b5579b4fcfec6d7bf392e620100062da6861def7e979d5dd3c73"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8dd7650a4fb0c6fec234249ac76d30aa3412867df6ddce52acca291e765543c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "詩成之後，天也陰陰地晚了；趕下山來，還在暮天鐘鼓聲中，上極樂寺去求了兩張籤詩。",
      "output_sha256": "4c47e6780584867605a27f77764575c398ec8a17775150a7674e616446d1770b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c47e6780584867605a27f77764575c398ec8a17775150a7674e616446d1770b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其一是昭君和番的故事，詩曰：“一山如畫對晴江，門裏團圓事事雙，誰料半途分析去，空幃無語對銀工。”",
      "output_sha256": "6525fbe836649d9a6b3f9dd452ba032ffabc0bbe5fecc18f46233adfac3aaa50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.917741,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2b0dab17078ddeb34955f53935eb3936cdd3636acc07bc15e51f713f4e4ef95f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6525fbe836649d9a6b3f9dd452ba032ffabc0bbe5fecc18f46233adfac3aaa50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我所問的是前程，而他卻似在談家庭。",
      "output_sha256": "0b5bb38bfb06d13c71576597a6a3a2f78d9695ac251c5bc3a34644d5cc6f0530",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.655,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "98b0ab358e4843a3d60941a7914dffb7b0532d40056740f0f912473efa6d2009"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0b5bb38bfb06d13c71576597a6a3a2f78d9695ac251c5bc3a34644d5cc6f0530",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "詳猜不出，於是乎再來一次。",
      "output_sha256": "8fca3dbc2abddd020db5f4618748d254294923cf64e47b5eca83f05e00e2bfd6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "8fca3dbc2abddd020db5f4618748d254294923cf64e47b5eca83f05e00e2bfd6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其二是劉先生如魚得水的故事，詩曰：“草廬三顧恩難報，今日相逢喜十分，恰似旱天俄得雨，籌謀鼎足定乾坤。”",
      "output_sha256": "17b0d8c5b65a17cfb53f4be79a5766348018d279829dc94787432f4d0456f213",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.921604,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "edb114c117cfdd187478c5640a80d27ab0b9b0dc996d9a54f4e8b7fc1d767706"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "17b0d8c5b65a17cfb53f4be79a5766348018d279829dc94787432f4d0456f213",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "（前者第十四籤，後者第二十一籤。）",
      "output_sha256": "669ec911a764a2e628d4484308c517883e7fc9caf85d7661a1d6da75d5b76685",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.719615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e3d4baab3155bf04f96ccdf2d7065ca49dbe221ebaf9abc32354300b755139b0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "669ec911a764a2e628d4484308c517883e7fc9caf85d7661a1d6da75d5b76685",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "籤也求了，春滿園的飽飯也吃了，回來之後，身體疲倦得像棉花一樣。",
      "output_sha256": "5f024714dbdd6058dfb1c89f2e35be598f5f0e64a633d8f31c9912dc46df899a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f024714dbdd6058dfb1c89f2e35be598f5f0e64a633d8f31c9912dc46df899a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "夜半挑燈，起來記此一段遊蹤；明天再玩一天，再宿一宵，就須附車南下，去做剪刀漿糊，油墨硃筆的消費人。",
      "output_sha256": "96cb8beedd66fa08719efbc72c9d92701a4b92db8c1263bdc464089ae035d308",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "96cb8beedd66fa08719efbc72c9d92701a4b92db8c1263bdc464089ae035d308",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "歡娛苦短，來日方長，“三宿檳城戀有餘”──這一句自作的歪詩，我將在車廂裏念着，報館辦事房裏念着，甚至於每日清早的便所裏念着，直到我末日的來時爲止。",
      "output_sha256": "b2431b3a3a39cb60eb2fb5b2cb0ce92fcd89a95611bc6c9684edda12ae09dd9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2431b3a3a39cb60eb2fb5b2cb0ce92fcd89a95611bc6c9684edda12ae09dd9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一九三九年一月四日晨",
      "output_sha256": "9e1443c983be104604f79df11a2525a6673b103242e0ed452af207562facbdb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "9e1443c983be104604f79df11a2525a6673b103242e0ed452af207562facbdb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（原載一九三九年一月四日《星檳日報》）",
      "output_sha256": "cdf35db1a46ff3f42fac4ee8f32f4fe9fd1c4e5e6b7fbab651470745f8f8e7a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdf35db1a46ff3f42fac4ee8f32f4fe9fd1c4e5e6b7fbab651470745f8f8e7a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
